ncements in AI for UX Design<\/h3><p class=\"mb-30\">An Education Event is a dynamic platform designed to bring together students, educators, institutions, and industry experts to share knowledge, exchange ideas, and explore innovations in the world of learning. These events\u2014such as seminars, workshops, exhibitions, and conferences\u2014offer valuable opportunities for participants to engage with the latest educational trends, technologies, and methodologies. Education events often feature keynote speakers, live demonstrations, and interactive sessions that inspire creativity, collaboration, and professional growth.<\/p><p class=\"mb-50\">Whether held in-person or online, they serve as a bridge between academic excellence and real-world application, empowering learners and educators alike to stay informed, inspired, and connected in an ever-evolving educational landscape.<\/p><h4 class=\"h5 mt-n2 mb-4\">What You Will Learn?<\/h4><div class=\"checklist style3 mb-50\"><ul><li>Covering essential topics like entrepreneurship, marketing<\/li><li>Regular live sessions with industry professionals for real-time learning.<\/li><li>Interactive tests to reinforce knowledge and track progress.<\/li><li>Learning from successful business models and failures.<\/li><li>A recognized certificate to boost credibility.<\/li><li>Networking opportunities with industry leaders will enhance career prospects.<\/li><\/ul><\/div><h4 class=\"h5 mt-n2 mb-4\">Event Location<\/h4><div class=\"event-details-map mb-50\"><iframe src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3644.7310056272386!2d89.2286059153658!3d24.00527418490799!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x39fe9b97badc6151%3A0x30b048c9fb2129bc!2sAngfuztheme!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sbd!4v1658812932163!5m2!1sen!2sbd\"><\/iframe><\/div><h4 class=\"h5 mt-n2 mb-4\">Event Speakers<\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d9b53b elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-w